# Frontend build settings (Vite). Only VITE_* values are included in the build,
# and they are PUBLIC: never put passwords, SMTP settings or secrets here.
#
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL UNSET, both on Vercel and locally. The app then calls
# /api on its own address:
#   - Vercel: frontend/vercel.json forwards /api/* to the Render backend.
#   - Local:  the Vite dev server forwards /api to the backend on 127.0.0.1:4000.
# Only set it if the API is served from a different origin on the SAME site
# (e.g. app.example.com -> api.example.com); otherwise sign-in cookies break.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
